       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID.    NWC520.
       AUTHOR.        R. SINGH.
       INSTALLATION.  NORTHWIND TRADERS - DALLAS DIVISION.
       DATE-WRITTEN.  07/07/08.
      *****************************************************************
      *  CUSTOMER DEMOGRAPHIC TYPES
      *
      *  PARAMETER: CUSTOMER NUMBER X(5) (FROM NWC100)
      *  07/07/08 RS         COPY OF NWC510
      *****************************************************************
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
       SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-AS400.
       OBJECT-COMPUTER. IBM-AS400.
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT DSPFILE ASSIGN TO WORKSTATION-NWC520D-SI
               ORGANIZATION IS TRANSACTION
               ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RELATIVE KEY IS WS-RRN
               FILE STATUS IS WS-DSP-STAT.
           SELECT CUSDEM ASSIGN TO DATABASE-CUSDEM
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
               ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS CD-KEY
               FILE STATUS IS WS-CUSDEM-STAT.
           SELECT CUSMST ASSIGN TO DATABASE-CUSMST
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
               ACCESS MODE IS RANDOM
               RECORD KEY IS CM-KEY
               FILE STATUS IS WS-CUSMST-STAT.
           SELECT CODTBL ASSIGN TO DATABASE-CODTBL
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
               ACCESS MODE IS RANDOM
               RECORD KEY IS CT-KEY
               FILE STATUS IS WS-CODTBL-STAT.
       DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
       FD  DSPFILE
           LABEL RECORDS ARE OMITTED.
       01  DSP-REC                     PIC X(2000).
       FD  CUSDEM
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
           COPY CUSDEMCP.
       FD  CUSMST
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
           COPY CUSMSTCP.
       FD  CODTBL
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
           COPY CODTBLCP.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       77  WS-RRN                      PIC 9(4)  VALUE ZERO.
       77  WS-DSP-STAT                 PIC XX    VALUE SPACES.
       77  WS-CUSDEM-STAT              PIC XX    VALUE SPACES.
       77  WS-CUSMST-STAT              PIC XX    VALUE SPACES.
       77  WS-CODTBL-STAT              PIC XX    VALUE SPACES.
       77  WS-MSG-LINE                 PIC X(78) VALUE SPACES.
       77  WS-CODE                     PIC X(10) VALUE SPACES.
       01  WS-IND-AREA.
           05  WS-IND      PIC 1 OCCURS 99 TIMES INDICATOR 1.
       01  SFLREC-I-AREA.
           COPY DDS-SFLREC-I OF NWC520D.
       01  SFLREC-O-AREA.
           COPY DDS-SFLREC-O OF NWC520D.
       01  SFLCTL-O-AREA.
           COPY DDS-SFLCTL-O OF NWC520D.
       01  FMT01-O-AREA.
           COPY DDS-FMT01-O OF NWC520D.
       01  ADDREC-I-AREA.
           COPY DDS-ADDREC-I OF NWC520D.
       01  ADDREC-O-AREA.
           COPY DDS-ADDREC-O OF NWC520D.
       01  WS-MSG-VALUES.
           05  FILLER  PIC X(40) VALUE "EMPLOYEE NOT ON FILE".
           05  FILLER  PIC X(40) VALUE "NO TERRITORIES ASSIGNED".
           05  FILLER  PIC X(40) VALUE "TYPE REMOVED".
           05  FILLER  PIC X(40) VALUE "TYPE ADDED".
           05  FILLER  PIC X(40) VALUE "CODE NOT ON FILE".
           05  FILLER  PIC X(40) VALUE "ALREADY ASSIGNED".
       01  WS-MSG-TABLE REDEFINES WS-MSG-VALUES.
           05  WS-MSG                  PIC X(40) OCCURS 6 TIMES.
       LINKAGE SECTION.
       01  LK-PARM                     PIC X(5).
       PROCEDURE DIVISION USING LK-PARM.
       0000-MAINLINE.
           OPEN I-O DSPFILE CUSDEM.
           OPEN INPUT CUSMST CODTBL.
           MOVE ALL "0" TO WS-IND-AREA.
           INITIALIZE SFLCTL-O-AREA ADDREC-O-AREA.
           MOVE LK-PARM TO CM-CUST C1KEY OF SFLCTL-O.
           READ CUSMST
               INVALID KEY MOVE WS-MSG(1) TO C1NAME OF SFLCTL-O
               NOT INVALID KEY MOVE CM-NAME TO C1NAME OF SFLCTL-O
           END-READ.
           PERFORM 1000-LOAD THRU 1000-EXIT.
       0100-SHOW.
           MOVE WS-MSG-LINE TO MSGLIN OF FMT01-O.
           WRITE DSP-REC FROM FMT01-O-AREA FORMAT IS "FMT01"
               INDICATORS ARE WS-IND-AREA.
           WRITE DSP-REC FROM SFLCTL-O-AREA FORMAT IS "SFLCTL"
               INDICATORS ARE WS-IND-AREA.
           READ DSPFILE FORMAT IS "SFLCTL"
               INDICATORS ARE WS-IND-AREA.
           MOVE SPACES TO WS-MSG-LINE.
           IF WS-IND(03) = B"1" OR WS-IND(12) = B"1"
               GO TO 9000-END.
           IF WS-IND(06) = B"1"
               PERFORM 4000-ADD THRU 4000-EXIT.
           PERFORM 2000-OPTIONS THRU 2000-EXIT.
           PERFORM 1000-LOAD THRU 1000-EXIT.
           GO TO 0100-SHOW.
       9000-END.
           CLOSE DSPFILE CUSDEM CUSMST CODTBL.
           GOBACK.
      *---------------------------------------------------------------
       1000-LOAD.
           MOVE B"1" TO WS-IND(33).
           MOVE B"0" TO WS-IND(31).
           MOVE B"0" TO WS-IND(32).
           WRITE DSP-REC FROM SFLCTL-O-AREA FORMAT IS "SFLCTL"
               INDICATORS ARE WS-IND-AREA.
           MOVE B"0" TO WS-IND(33).
           MOVE ZERO TO WS-RRN.
           MOVE LK-PARM TO CD-CUST.
           MOVE SPACES TO CD-TYPE.
           START CUSDEM KEY IS NOT LESS THAN CD-KEY
               INVALID KEY GO TO 1000-DONE.
       1000-READ.
           READ CUSDEM NEXT RECORD AT END GO TO 1000-DONE.
           IF CD-CUST NOT = LK-PARM GO TO 1000-DONE.
           ADD 1 TO WS-RRN.
           MOVE SPACE TO S1OPT OF SFLREC-O.
           MOVE CD-TYPE TO S1CODE OF SFLREC-O H1CODE OF SFLREC-O.
           MOVE "DEM" TO CT-TYPE.
           MOVE CD-TYPE TO CT-CODE.
           READ CODTBL
               INVALID KEY MOVE "*NOT ON FILE" TO S1DESC OF SFLREC-O
               NOT INVALID KEY MOVE CT-DESC TO S1DESC OF SFLREC-O
           END-READ.
           WRITE SUBFILE DSP-REC FROM SFLREC-O-AREA FORMAT IS "SFLREC"
               INDICATORS ARE WS-IND-AREA.
           GO TO 1000-READ.
       1000-DONE.
           MOVE B"1" TO WS-IND(32).
           MOVE B"1" TO WS-IND(34).
           IF WS-RRN > ZERO
               MOVE B"1" TO WS-IND(31)
           ELSE
               MOVE WS-MSG(2) TO WS-MSG-LINE.
       1000-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *---------------------------------------------------------------
       2000-OPTIONS.
           READ SUBFILE DSPFILE NEXT MODIFIED RECORD
               INTO SFLREC-I-AREA FORMAT IS "SFLREC"
               AT END GO TO 2000-EXIT.
           IF S1OPT OF SFLREC-I = "4"
               MOVE LK-PARM TO CD-CUST
               MOVE H1CODE OF SFLREC-I TO CD-TYPE
               DELETE CUSDEM RECORD INVALID KEY CONTINUE END-DELETE
               MOVE WS-MSG(3) TO WS-MSG-LINE.
           GO TO 2000-OPTIONS.
       2000-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *---------------------------------------------------------------
       4000-ADD.
           MOVE SPACES TO A1CODE OF ADDREC-O A1MSG OF ADDREC-O.
       4000-SHOW.
           WRITE DSP-REC FROM ADDREC-O-AREA FORMAT IS "ADDREC"
               INDICATORS ARE WS-IND-AREA.
           READ DSPFILE INTO ADDREC-I-AREA FORMAT IS "ADDREC"
               INDICATORS ARE WS-IND-AREA.
           MOVE B"0" TO WS-IND(51).
           IF WS-IND(03) = B"1" OR WS-IND(12) = B"1" GO TO 4000-EXIT.
           MOVE A1CODE OF ADDREC-I TO A1CODE OF ADDREC-O WS-CODE.
           MOVE "DEM" TO CT-TYPE.
           MOVE WS-CODE TO CT-CODE.
           READ CODTBL INVALID KEY
               MOVE B"1" TO WS-IND(51)
               MOVE WS-MSG(5) TO A1MSG OF ADDREC-O
               GO TO 4000-SHOW.
           MOVE LK-PARM TO CD-CUST.
           MOVE WS-CODE TO CD-TYPE.
           WRITE CUSDEM-REC INVALID KEY
               MOVE B"1" TO WS-IND(51)
               MOVE WS-MSG(6) TO A1MSG OF ADDREC-O
               GO TO 4000-SHOW.
           MOVE WS-MSG(4) TO WS-MSG-LINE.
       4000-EXIT.
           EXIT.
